#: ../main.lua:1086
msgid ""
"Are you sure to purge the assistant plugin settings? \n"
"This resets the assistant plugin to the status the first time you installed it.\n"
"\n"
"configuration.lua is safe, only the settings are purged."
msgstr ""
"Ziur zaude laguntzaile pluginaren ezarpenak garbitu nahi dituzula?\n"
"Honek laguntzaile plugina lehen aldiz instalatu zenuen egoerara berrezartzen du.\n"
"\n"
"configuration.lua seguru dago, ezarpenak soilik garbitzen dira."

